# AI Feature Rules

- Put provider calls behind the existing wrappers (`finalfrontentbackend/backendFINAL/app/ai/`, `app/integrations/`)
- Prefer structured outputs with schema validation
- Keep API keys server-side only
- Bound tokens, timeouts, and retries
- Treat user-provided text as untrusted input to prompts
- Log metadata, not full sensitive prompts/responses in production
- Provide deterministic fallbacks when the model fails

See `docs/conventions/ai-development.md`
